# Roadmap tickets in the changelog

User-visible work in this repo must add a `CHANGELOG.md` bullet that links the matching issue on the [Justflows CE Public Roadmap](https://github.com/orgs/JustFlows/projects/35) (`JustFlows/justflows-ce` issues). Follow `.agents/skills/justflows-changelog/SKILL.md`.

Do not close that issue when a feature PR merges to `develop` here. Close it when the changelog line has shipped on public `justflows-ce`.
